\pard\b\fs20 Fields of Glory, Heavy Fortress\b0\par
\fs16\par
When winter set in, the fighting over Clonkolou died down, and the knights withdrew to their positions. Until spring, they fortified the open camps and built heavy fortresses.\par
In each team, one player starts with an armored knight and another with a king. The other players each get a normal knight.\par
After that, every player has 10 more knights in reserve.\par
As a reward for each defeated enemy, a player gets a magic potion, and the value of the killed clonk is credited to his account.\par
If you manage to kill three enemy knights, you receive a Heal group scroll.\par
For six defeated enemies your knight is upgraded to a king, or to a black knight if he is wearing armor; if you already are a king, you receive a mighty spell.\par
More equipment can be bought for money at the office and the tent, even without a flag.\par
And useful materials are provided on the bridge in the village.\par
